        -:    5: * execution counts, and nothing here is instrumented with the SDA probe shim.
        -:    6: *
        -:    7: *   line 21  allocation in dead code, gcov measures it at zero  -> unreached
        -:    8: *   line 30  leaked allocation, Memcheck reports the loss       -> confirmed
        -:    9: *   line 37  library call in a hot loop, executed 40 times      -> refuted
        -:   10: *
        -:   11: * See tools/coverage-wsl/README.md for the commands that drive it.
        -:   12: */
        -:   13:#include <stdio.h>
